<html lang='zh-TW'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>{{subject}}</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family:
          'Microsoft JhengHei',
          'PingFang TC',
          -apple-system,
          'Segoe UI',
          sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background-color: #f4f6f9;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 8px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .header {
        background-color: #1a365d;
        color: white;
        padding: 28px 24px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .header h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 32px 24px;
      }
      .content p {
        margin: 0 0 16px;
      }
      .info-box {
        background-color: #f7f8fa;
        border-left: 4px solid #2b6cb0;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .info-box h3 {
        margin: 0 0 10px;
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #1a365d;
      }
      .info-box ul {
        margin: 8px 0 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
      .info-box li {
        margin: 4px 0;
      }
      .warning {
        background-color: #fffbeb;
        border-left: 4px solid #d69e2e;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .footer {
        background-color: #f7f8fa;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888;
        border-top: 1px solid #e8ecf1;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        {{#if isCreated}}
          <h2>🔑 個人存取權杖已建立</h2>
        {{else}}
          <h2>🔒 個人存取權杖已撤銷</h2>
        {{/if}}
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <p>{{userName}}，您好：</p>

        {{#if isCreated}}
          <p>您已成功建立一個新的個人存取權杖。</p>
        {{else}}
          <p>您的一個個人存取權杖已被撤銷，無法再使用。</p>
        {{/if}}

        <div class='info-box'>
          <h3>權杖資訊</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>名稱：</strong>{{tokenName}}</li>
            <li><strong>前綴：</strong>{{tokenPrefix}}...</li>
            {{#if scopes}}<li><strong>權限範圍：</strong>{{scopes}}</li>{{/if}}
            {{#if expiresAt}}<li><strong
                >到期時間：</strong>{{expiresAt}}</li>{{/if}}
            <li><strong>操作時間：</strong>{{timestamp}}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class='warning'>
          <strong>⚠️ 安全提醒：</strong>
          {{#if isCreated}}
            <p
              style='margin: 8px 0 0;'
            >請妥善保管您的權杖，切勿與他人共享。如果您沒有執行此操作，請立即撤銷該權杖並聯繫支援團隊。</p>
          {{else}}
            <p
              style='margin: 8px 0 0;'
            >如果您沒有執行此操作，您的帳號可能已被盜用。請立即變更密碼並聯繫支援團隊。</p>
          {{/if}}
        </div>

        <p><strong>支援郵箱：</strong><a
            href='mailto:{{supportEmail}}'
            style='color: #2b6cb0;'
          >{{supportEmail}}</a></p>
        <p style='text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;'>
          <a
            href='{{dashboardUrl}}'
            style='display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; background-color: #2b6cb0; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;'
          >前往系統</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>此郵件由系統自動發送，請勿直接回覆。</p>
        <p>&copy; 2026 加雲聯網 Intelligent Cloud Plus, Inc. All rights
          reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>